Formal CUDA evidence review after human clarification

Human decision:
The startup failure caused by the wrong model loading path did not load the
model, did not reach the capture hook, and produced no sample. It does not
count as a Capture Session.

Applied to the uploaded evidence:
- PID 98141 failed before model load and produced no sample: not counted.
- PID 114828 loaded the fixed checkpoint and produced all three saved shapes:
  counted as the one formal Capture Session.
- The three sample files match sample-files.json size and SHA-256 metadata.
- The record-samples result, Golden state, and CUDA self-replay result bind the
  same sample-files.json SHA-256.
- Source-side review did not deserialize Tensor payloads; CUDA self-replay is
  accepted from its sealed runtime evidence.

Decision:
Supersede cuda-formal-review-r5-001, accept runs/cuda-golden-r5-001, mark the
formal Session SEALED, and prepare the CUDA-side Handoff Bundle build/verify
without restarting the model.
